### Virtual Crane 
Option 1: Virtual CANController
sudo modprobe vcan
sudo ip link add dev vcan0 type vcan
sudo ip link set vcan0 txqueuelen 1000
sudo ip link set up vcan0



ros2 launch tower_crane_moveit_config bringup.launch.py can_interface_name:=vcan0


colcon build --symlink-install
ros2 launch crane_master canopen_ros2.launch.py can_interface_name:=vcan0

